@@ -23,7 +23,7 @@
 ## Design Principles
 
 - Keep the learner's next action clear.
-- Keep classroom controls visually consistent across current and historical discussion.
+- Keep classroom controls visually consistent across current and historical discussion. Desktop discussion choices, history actions and playback controls share a 36 px height; coarse-pointer controls use 48 px. Voice capture remains a larger dedicated target.
 - Scope the student theme to classroom chrome; preserve authored lesson and whiteboard content.
 - Preserve meaningful status labels and the existing interaction flow.
 
